dyzJ\n細身でエースより少し背が低い！大きな尻尾と角が特徴的な竜人です。生意気な不良です！\n\n炎やエネルギーを操り、共に分かち合うエナジーソードを振るう姿を描いていただけたら、こんな感じになります。https://i.imgur.com/Jvh0GSO.jpg\n\nエースは真剣で、シーゲイザーは誇り高い！好きなポーズや設定で自由に描いてください！\n\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@iouytuuyio/works/52", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4f564896/uploads/origins/505a6d87-dc8d-4078-9b7f-45070cde262e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=08d8f7f9f9c8e5211aacb6cddcd26164", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4f564896/uploads/origins/505a6d87-dc8d-4078-9b7f-45070cde262e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=08d8f7f9f9c8e5211aacb6cddcd26164, https://si.imgix.net/4f564896/uploads/origins/505a6d87-dc8d-4078-9b7f-45070cde262e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bd093b0453cb1025ad4ceae2b7750ce0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4f564896/uploads/origins/505a6d87-dc8d-4078-9b7f-45070cde262e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b099ca9cf0f9f0d5bf3fe84c2aa430c3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@iouytuuyio/works/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d33be7ec/uploads/origins/6e54f307-6563-435d-865b-8155723eb344?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19648e61227eb6833e4de8a03d29af5b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d33be7ec/uploads/origins/6e54f307-6563-435d-865b-8155723eb344?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19648e61227eb6833e4de8a03d29af5b, ht